OL,3,GNEWSAFrom lockdown video games to pro
OL,4,Aracing driver
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 21-year-old racing driver has spoken
OL,7,Fof his "unconventional" route into
OL,8,Fmotor-racing - which began with
OL,9,Fcomputer games during the Covid-19
OL,10,Flockdown.
OL,12,FWill Redford, a race winner at the GT
OL,13,FChallenge de las Americas last month,
OL,14,Fsaid it was his dad that got him into
OL,15,Fthe sport in the first place.
OL,17,FHe said: "My dad had always been really
OL,18,Finto racing sims and stuff like that
OL,19,Fand he bought me a subscription to a
OL,20,Fprogramme called iRacing and there was
OL,21,Fnothing else to do, I got right into
OL,22,Fit."
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
